{"name":"The Fourth Glass","slug":"glyph-fourth-glass","blurb":"On the depth street, Dove carries the glass toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Fourth. Click the glass and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Fourth Glass.","seal":"119fffff93ca50b73a964919b5dd20802a629f38d63a11965d39ad5e0b71f9ee"}
